WEBVTT

00:00:26.977 --> 00:00:32.561
I'm listening to the sounds of silence.

00:00:32.585 --> 00:00:35.642
I don't think you understand.

00:00:35.666 --> 00:00:39.492
I think your phone lines are unmanned.

00:00:39.516 --> 00:00:42.788
I punched every touch tone I was told,

00:00:42.812 --> 00:00:45.975
but I've still spent 18 hours on hold.

00:00:45.999 --> 00:00:48.976
It's not enough your software
crashed my Mac,

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:52.537
and it constantly hangs and bombs --

00:00:52.561 --> 00:00:55.121
it erased my ROMs!

00:00:55.145 --> 00:00:59.486
Now the Mac makes the sounds of silence.